      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹137 (vs ₹149 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹137 (down from ₹149 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹12.1b (up 11% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.21b (down 8.3% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 10.0% (down from 12% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 9.9% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 19% growth forecast for the Electronic industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 8% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 5% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
